    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A visual novel with RPG elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong><br>\u00abFreedom is measured in lives.\u00bb</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >America is dead. The ashes of the past are scattered over the wastelands, where everyone is on their own. You are the leader of a band of raiders, whose specialty is the capture and sale of slaves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goal is simple:</strong> to accumulate enough wealth to leave everything behind and disappear forever into the luxury of Old Vegas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the road to paradise runs through betrayal, blood and constant risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step brings you closer to your dream... or to a bullet in the back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Does Solo shoot first?</strong> Choose who you will be \u2014 a charismatic leader, a ruthless butcher or a cold-blooded strategist. The parameters of the hero affect the style of the game and the available solutions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the monsters:</strong> the raiders have a character. If you play the good guy too much, you'll lose your credibility. If you push too hard, there will be a riot.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficult moral choices:</strong> prisoners, allies, prey \u2014 everything can become both a resource and a threat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The wasteland breathes death:</strong> randomized events along the way, mutant attacks, ambushes of competitors and hunger \u2014 challenges do not wait in turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no right solutions here. Just you, your gang, and a path strewn with ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Old Vegas is waiting. But will you live to see it?</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A visual novel with RPG elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong><br>\u00abFreedom is measured in lives.\u00bb</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >America is dead. The ashes of the past are scattered over the wastelands, where everyone is on their own. You are the leader of a band of raiders, whose specialty is the capture and sale of slaves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goal is simple:</strong> to accumulate enough wealth to leave everything behind and disappear forever into the luxury of Old Vegas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the road to paradise runs through betrayal, blood and constant risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step brings you closer to your dream... or to a bullet in the back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Does Solo shoot first?</strong> Choose who you will be \u2014 a charismatic leader, a ruthless butcher or a cold-blooded strategist. The parameters of the hero affect the style of the game and the available solutions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control the monsters:</strong> the raiders have a character. If you play the good guy too much, you'll lose your credibility. If you push too hard, there will be a riot.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficult moral choices:</strong> prisoners, allies, prey \u2014 everything can become both a resource and a threat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The wasteland breathes death:</strong> randomized events along the way, mutant attacks, ambushes of competitors and hunger \u2014 challenges do not wait in turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no right solutions here. Just you, your gang, and a path strewn with ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Old Vegas is waiting. But will you live to see it?</i></p>",
